## Project Structure & Organization

### Directory Organization

```
project-root/
├── backend/                # Python backend
│   ├── src/               # Python source code
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   ├── scraper/       # Web scraping modules
│   │   ├── tts/           # Text-to-speech engine
│   │   ├── llm/           # LLM annotation modules
│   │   ├── services/      # Business logic services
│   │   ├── utils/         # Utility functions
│   │   └── web/           # FastAPI backend
│   │       ├── app.py
│   │       ├── routes.py
│   │       └── ...
│   ├── tests/             # Test code (mirrors src/)
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   └── test_module.py
│   ├── requirements.txt   # Python production dependencies
│   ├── requirements-dev.txt # Python development dependencies
│   ├── pytest.ini         # Test configuration
│   └── README.md          # Backend-specific documentation
├── frontend/              # TypeScript/React frontend
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── components/    # React components
│   │   ├── store/         # Zustand state management
│   │   ├── styles/        # CSS modules
│   │   ├── types/         # TypeScript type definitions
│   │   ├── App.tsx
│   │   └── main.tsx
│   ├── package.json       # Node.js dependencies
│   ├── tsconfig.json      # TypeScript configuration
│   ├── vite.config.ts     # Vite build configuration
│   ├── index.html         # HTML entry point
│   └── README.md          # Frontend-specific documentation
├── data/                   # Runtime data (gitignored)
│   ├── databases/
│   ├── uploads/
│   ├── exports/
│   └── checkpoints/
├── logs/                   # Application logs (gitignored)
├── docs/                   # Living documentation
│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md
│   ├── API.md
│   └── RUNBOOK.md
├── .archive/               # Temporal documentation
│   ├── plans/
│   └── reports/
├── scripts/                # Utility scripts
├── .github/workflows/      # CI/CD configurations
├── .cursorrules           # Project-specific rules
├── README.md              # Main documentation
├── SETUP.md               # Setup instructions
├── Makefile               # Build automation
├── .gitignore
└── .env.example           # Credential template
```

### Documentation Organization

**Living Documentation** (constantly updated):
- `docs/` directory
- README.md, SETUP.md in root
- Keep current with code changes
- Version control

**Temporal Documentation** (point-in-time snapshots):
- `.archive/` directory
- Completed plans
- Progress reports
- Design decisions
- Review summaries
- Never delete, only archive

**Generated Documentation:**
- API docs (auto-generated)
- Coverage reports
- Metrics reports
- Performance benchmarks

### Runtime Data Management

**Principles:**
- NEVER commit runtime data
- Use `.gitkeep` to track empty directories
- Tools create directories automatically
- Default paths point to organized locations

**Data Categories:**
- `data/` - All runtime-generated files
- `logs/` - All application and test logs
- `cache/` - Temporary cache files
- `.pytest_cache/`, `.mypy_cache/` - Tool caches

### Path Management

- Use relative paths from project root
- Make paths configurable via environment variables
- Group related files together
- Document default paths clearly

